## Model card

- **Name:** Kimi K2.8 Preview
- **Short description:** Moonshot AI's coding model in the Kimi Code line, released September 11, 2026; successor to Kimi K2.7 Code; Kimi K3's low/high/max thinking levels; 1M-token context on every membership tier (up from 262,144 for K2.7 Code); text+image+video input, text output; proprietary; available via Kimi Code, not open weights or pay-per-token API.
- **Provider / access:** Moonshot AI (Kimi Code, kimi-for-coding model ID); API via moonshot.ai.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-09-11; knowledge cutoff not stated.
- **IDs:** `moonshotai/kimi-k2.8-preview` (opencode.ai), `kimi-k2.8-preview` (model-queue slug). No Free ID confirmed on OpenCode Zen.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens declared (opencode.ai, nextaimodel.com, kimi.com docs); max output not stated; no public long-context retrieval score.
- **Modalities:** Text + image + video in, text out (multimodal); reasoning yes (low/high/max effort levels); tool calls yes; structured output not explicitly advertised.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-20):** Not publicly listed as pay-per-token (Kimi Code subscription model); opencode.ai lists input/output as unavailable; $0 total spend observed; no per-token pricing published.
- **Architecture:** Undisclosed (parameter count, MoE/dense not published for K2.8 Preview); proprietary.

### Raw benchmarks found

No standardized benchmark scores found in any source checked. Vertical Tabs explicitly states "No benchmark results have been matched to this model yet." opencode.ai shows 0 usage tokens and 0 unique users. No GPQA, HLE, MMLU, SWE-bench, LiveCodeBench, or other public benchmark results exist.

### Normalized scores (1–100)

All quality dimensions and Overall are marked insufficient evidence; no numeric scores are assigned.

- **Tool use: insufficient evidence.** No public agent/tool benchmarks.
- **Reasoning: insufficient evidence.** No public reasoning benchmarks.
- **Context window: insufficient evidence.** Declared 1M tokens (spec sheet); no public retrieval score.
- **Multimodal: insufficient evidence.** Text+image+video in claimed; no vision benchmark scores.
- **Coding: insufficient evidence.** No public coding benchmarks.
- **Cost efficiency: not scored** (per formula).
- **Overall Score: not computed — insufficient evidence.** No dimensional scores available to average.

